// One-time scene setup: build all three meshes (player, target, pillar
// field -- world/scene/mesh/objects). The projection and camera-view
// matrices are NOT built here: unlike demos/gl3d (which holds one matrix
// handle for its whole run), this game rebuilds them fresh every frame in
// render/frame.id, so a long play session never holds a handle across
// frames into the native matrix pool (see backends/gl/README.md's "known
// rough edges" on the pool being an unfreed ring buffer).

scene_init() {
  init_player_mesh();
  init_target_mesh();
  init_pillar_mesh();
} return void;
